 "title": "High Schoolers Analyzing Lunar Missions",
 "cat": "space",
 "emoji": "🚀",
 "sentences": [
  "High schoolers modeled real lunar mission data.",
  "The NASA SEES MATRIX team analyzed propellant management for the upcoming IM-3 moon mission.",
  "They used public flight data to predict how fuel behaves in microgravity.",
  "The team identified when acoustic sensors can accurately measure fuel.",
  "They even presented their sophisticated findings to actual propulsion engineers.",
  "These students proved that public data can unlock complex spaceflight challenges."
